    "detailed_description": "<strong>TRIBUTE </strong>is a 3v3 battle arena with the core gameplay built around on-field heroes switching, strategic points capturing, and lane-pushing control<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Switch heroes:</strong> Choose three heroes for the match and seamlessly swap between them on the battlefield. Unleash the full potential of each hero, triggering powerful batteries as you switch.<br></li><li><strong>Capture strategic points:</strong> Capture control points and deploy versatile structures. Secure the area with Outposts or push the enemy base with Drone Stations. Dominate the battlefield through control point management.<br></li><li><strong>Team up:</strong> Join forces with your team to create unique tactics, utilizing hero synergies for maximum impact. Outsmart enemies with strategic teamwork and launch powerful combos on the battlefield.</li></ul>",
